        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 12/D9000AUS32D, #12 Stainless Steel Entry Lever Set with Stainless Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia #12 Stainless Steel Levers feature a very simple, clean contemporary design making them a popular design choice for professionals. The entry door package includes a matching high security single cylinder stainless steel deadbolt. The mounting screws are concealed to complete the clean, contemporary look expected from Omnia door hardware. For use on entry doors or any door that requires a security locking. All the components, including the latch, screws and strike plates are stainless steel. Strong, durable, and beautiful this easy to install lever and deadbolt kit will fit standard pre-drilled doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior. The lever latch operates from either side of door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-54628-SM.jpg?v=1704354587\" width=\"588\" height=\"152\" border=\"0\" alt=\"OMN 12/D9000AUS32D Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-door-lever-set-omnia-12\"><b>Omnia #12 Door Lever Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Omnia Stainless Steel Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Schlage “C” keyway</li>\r\n<li>High Security 1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable faceplate / armor plate for beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia #12 Stainless Entry Lever Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li> \r\n<li>Lever Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt  Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li> \r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-5/8”</li> \r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction </li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 1 single cylinder deadbolt, 2 passage levers with rosettes, and mounting screws.\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
